    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-pwa-3252",
      "display_title": "Issue #3252: [Profile Setting] Integrate API Edit Profile V2",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">edit-profile.webm</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-c4374153-b54e-4194-bc3b-a9702f1266ce.webm\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-c4374153-b54e-4194-bc3b-a9702f1266ce.webm\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5076996297\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/426\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/426/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/426\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new#426</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">City Data</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"images/image-8ae79a9e-58a6-4c51-a283-22ba443e25b8.png\">location.json</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Route</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"PATCH /v2/users/me/profile\nAuthorization: &lt;JWT token&gt;\nContent-Type: application/json\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">PATCH</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /v2/users/me/profile</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Authorization:</span> &lt;JWT token&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Content-Type:</span> application/json</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Payload</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;username&quot;: &quot;ipebbbbb&quot;,\n  &quot;fullname&quot;: &quot;Pebi Sandi P&quot;,\n  &quot;about&quot;: &quot;Exploring the world in 360°.&quot;,\n  &quot;country&quot;: &quot;Indonesia&quot;,\n  &quot;city&quot;: &quot;Bandung&quot;,\n  &quot;website&quot;: &quot;linktr.ee/ipebbbbb&quot;\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"username\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>ipebbbbb<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"fullname\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Pebi Sandi P<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"about\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Exploring the world in 360°.<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"country\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Indonesia<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"city\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Bandung<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"website\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>linktr.ee/ipebbbbb<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Omitted fields remain unchanged. Country and city must be populated after update. Website normalizes to HTTPS.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Success</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{&quot;statusCode&quot;:200,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;valid&quot;:true,&quot;messages&quot;:&quot;Success update profile&quot;}}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">200</span>,<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>:{<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Success update profile<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>}}</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Changes</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added V2 action, controller, and PATCH route.</li>\n<li>Reused legacy username/fullname validation behavior.</li>\n<li>Added about, country, city, and website validation.</li>\n<li>Added Redis refresh, Elasticsearch username update, and live Maps Panorra sync.</li>\n<li>No encrypted response.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Errors</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">400</code>: invalid JSON.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">401</code>: invalid auth or role.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">409</code>: user missing or username conflict.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">422</code>: invalid fields or missing final country/city.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">500</code>: database or downstream sync failure.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Endpoint</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">PATCH /v2/users/me/profile</code></p>",
      "metadata": {
        "number": 3252,
        "author": "anurdin01",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-04T08:36:27Z"
      }
    },
